  "annotations": [
    { "id": "home-redesign-note", "x": 0, "y": -110, "w": 1840, "page": "home-redesign", "text": "Home screen redesign — inspired by a wallet-app reference (hero stat, pill actions, quick-action row, recent list, floating tab bar), reskinned in Yieldd navy/gold.\nA: closest evolution of the current app. B: purest \"one button, nothing competes\" spec reading, most whitespace. C: event-switcher as the primary surface, for reps running multiple shows. D: boldest — layered card depth, embedded FAB, a featured \"just captured\" lead card.\nE: the user's pick — A's header/hero/event-switcher/quick-actions on top, B's stat-strip/recent-leads/tab-bar on the bottom. Hero rebalanced to a 2-column layout, no scan/manual buttons (camera FAB is the only scan entry point), Profile tab removed (avatar in header covers that).\nF: same as E, but the tab bar is flat (not a floating pill) and the camera sits centered inline in the bar row, level with Home/Events — nothing floats or overlaps above it." }
